{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114387","id":3132610365,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc66t9c9","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114387","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114387.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114387.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114387","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114387/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114387/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114387/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/9941284c0116503bf23c4198851e9c88f95a2bf2","number":114387,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix `Input.is_action_just_pressed_by_event` / `Input.is_action_just_released_by_event` not working for `InputEventMouseButton`","user":{"login":"TranquilMarmot","id":504259,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDI1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/504259?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot","html_url":"https://github.com/TranquilMarmot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113472\r\n\r\nCurrently, `Input.is_action_just_pressed_by_event` and `Input.is_action_just_released_by_event` rely on comparing the event's `get_instance_id()`.\r\n\r\n_However,_ for `InputEventMouseButton` there are a few instances where the event is modified and a new instance is created.\r\n\r\nFor example...\r\n\r\nWhen `emulate_mouse_from_touch` is `true`:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/63227bbc8ae5300319f14f8253c8158b846f355b/core/input/input.cpp#L863-L885\r\n\r\nInside of `Input::ensure_touch_mouse_raised`:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/63227bbc8ae5300319f14f8253c8158b846f355b/core/input/input.cpp#L1166-L1187\r\n\r\nInside of `InputEventMouseButton::xformed_by`:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/63227bbc8ae5300319f14f8253c8158b846f355b/core/input/input_event.cpp#L742-L766\r\n\r\nThe fix I've implemented here is to store the `InputEvent` itself instead of just its instance ID and, when doing a comparison with an `InputEventMouseButton`, check if `is_match` is true.\r\n\r\nI tried to use `is_match` for other events but that wasn't as reliable as the instance ID and resulted in some events double-firing, so I opted to only fall back on it for the mouse input events.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","